  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Reproduce steps:\n1. Add any Type node from \"create node > Special > Types\" \n2. Open popup menu (not context menu, a menu that shows overload method usually)\n3. Close popuped menu (select one item or ESC key)\n4. Then all menus in Graph View wont be opened. (Or it opens with only separators.)\n\n* Even other popup menus on the out side of Graph View will also affected.\n* Workaround: Open popup menus on the out side of Graph View\n\nPossibly related Unity issue \"[Windows] Menu Item entries are limited to 1000\" https://issuetracker.unity3d.com/issues/windows-menu-item-entries-are-limited-to-1000 (The menu for Type node contains 1049 items.)",
